      },
      "worked": "By the cosine rule,\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2&=11^2+8^2-2(11)(8)\\cos50^\\circ\\\\x^2&=185-176\\cos50^\\circ\\\\x&=\\sqrt{185-176\\cos50^\\circ}\\approx8.48.\\end{align*}$$\nUse the unrounded value of $x$ in the rearranged cosine rule.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos\\theta&=\\frac{11^2+x^2-8^2}{2(11)x}\\\\\\cos\\theta&=\\frac{242-176\\cos50^\\circ}{22\\sqrt{185-176\\cos50^\\circ}}\\\\\\theta&=\\cos^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{242-176\\cos50^\\circ}{22\\sqrt{185-176\\cos50^\\circ}}\\right)\\approx46.3^\\circ.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
